# pstack model configuration. One line per role. Delete a line to fall back to the skill default.
# `inherit-parent` or `auto` as a value: the role runs on the parent chat model (omit Task `model`). Alias entries in a panel list still count toward its fan-out.
#
# STANDING LOCK (Nathan via Cap 2026-09-11, reinforced):
# - fast=false ALWAYS. Never *-fast-* / *-xhigh-fast / fast=true / cursor-*-fast.
# - No Fable lock unless Cap/Nathan explicitly order that climb.
# - CloudAgent parent launches must pass model grok-4.6 + model_params fast=false (or another non-fast slug). Roles inherit-parent so workers cannot reintroduce fast.
#
feature, refactoring: inherit-parent
bug-fix: inherit-parent
perf-issue: inherit-parent
hillclimb: inherit-parent
judgment and prose: inherit-parent
hardest tasks: inherit-parent
how explorer: inherit-parent
